# Default yosys-abc mapping script (same passes as yosys's built-in default).
# The bridge re-import names abc-created cells by their internal node names
# instead of liberty pin names, so the written netlist needs a post-process
# port fix before OpenSTA can link it (see syn/fix_ports.py). Area comes from
# the hierarchical stat -liberty in the same run.
strash
&get -n
&fraig -x
&put
scorr
dc2
dretime
strash
&get -n
&dch -f
&nf
&put
